{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:18:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect time series aggregation has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/40.", "utterranceID": "20261201-0-3954a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-0-3954a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:22:00", "text": "The root cause was a misconfiguration in the aggregation logic. We were using an incorrect time interval, which distorted the input data for our forecasting model.", "utterranceID": "20261201-1-b7a67"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-1-b7a67"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:24:00", "text": "To fix it, I updated the configuration to ensure the correct time intervals are used for aggregation. This involved modifying the logic to dynamically adjust based on the dataset's frequency.", "utterranceID": "20261201-2-0803a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-2-0803a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:28:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_1bf91687! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll test it out with the latest data.", "utterranceID": "20261201-3-6ab4c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-3-6ab4c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:30:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This should improve our trend predictions significantly. I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes.", "utterranceID": "20261201-4-b9bfb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-4-b9bfb"}
