{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8333ab24", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T01:31:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_6d9f2150! Could you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261004-1-aef9b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-1-aef9b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d9f2150", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T01:35:00", "text": "Sure, Julia. The root cause was an inefficient query execution plan in the database layer. It was creating bottlenecks during peak usage times, which led to delayed API responses and eventually timeout errors.", "utterranceID": "20261004-2-12dbd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-2-12dbd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T01:36:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Hannah. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261004-3-da7c5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-3-da7c5"}
