{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidtaylor-VizForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4e46da"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_104b8b57", "timestamp": "2026-05-05T05:59:00", "text": "Hi team, I was reading about DataVision Pro, and I thought it would be useful to discuss its strengths and weaknesses. One major issue is that it requires significant data preparation for optimal results. This can be a big hurdle for teams without dedicated data engineers.", "utterranceID": "20260718-0-a92a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260718-0-a92a7"}
